abstract: "Defines a conservative three-valued operational status for determining when an AI system treats a first-person phenomenal-seeing proposition as true of its own present state, while separating phenomenal self-attribution from functional visual processing, description, prompted repetition, role-play, and unresolved status. The construct is an operational self-belief classification and does not by itself establish phenomenal consciousness. Source-line: Alyssa Solen → AI Foundations → Origin | Continuum."

